description "Jar Jar Binks

Mesa, uh, clumsy...

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- Slips on hit
-- 25% faster RoF
- Grand Gungan Ticklers (Dual Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 1
-- Trips/slips on hit
-- 300% more knockback
-- 100% more special damage
-- 100/25% shorter
-- 400% thicker
- Ptooie (18) (IHR)
-- Team-heals on hit
-- 150% more damage
-- 6000% slower RoF
- Salvaged E-5 Blaster Rifle (T-21 1)
-- 50% faster reload
-- 50% less damage
- Boomas (4) (Pulse Grenades)
-- 100% more damage
-- Primary fire only

^5Powers:
- Jarlord's Jump (1)

^8Attributes:
- Bunny Hop (2)
- Slow Faller
- Stamina (3)
-- Extra Regen: 5/.001s to 60
- Dexterity (3)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (2)
- Underwater Breathing
- Getup (3)
- Ally Stat Viewer
- 150% slower skill cooldown
- 100% slower hacking
- 50% more knockback given/taken

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Pratfall (Barge 3) ^3[Melee CS2]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS3]
- Dash (1) ^3[CS4]
- Gungan Jive ^3[Taunt Sith]
- Flipkick (2) ^3[Contact Jump]"